From: Chiel Prins <chiel@cpeb.it>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: rk3308-cs307-e2w3: set model to AAWireless 1

The board reports itself as the Radxa reference design it derives from,
which is what shows up in /proc/device-tree/model and anywhere userspace
reads the device tree model. Name it for the product instead.

Signed-off-by: Chiel Prins <chiel@cpeb.it>
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3308-cs307-e2w3.dts	2026-09-18 19:47:04.379292886 +0200
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3308-cs307-e2w3.dts	2026-09-18 19:51:39.001234407 +0200
@@ -3,7 +3,7 @@
 #include "rk3308-cs307.dtsi"
 
 / {
-	model = "Radxa CS307-E2W3";
+	model = "AAWireless 1";
 };
 
 &wireless_wlan {
